      "geomMean_le_powerMean_pos (GM ≤ M_s for s > 0)",
      "powerMean_le_geomMean_neg (M_r ≤ GM for r < 0)"
    ],
    "open": [
      "Assemble pos/neg/mixed into a single uniform theorem M_p ≤ M_q for all p ≤ q over ℝ"
